      en: ["A vast, arid, and elevated expanse in the northern Central River Region.", "Characterized by tough, baked red earth and sparse, thorny Sahelian scrubland.", "Highly vulnerable to the creeping ecological effects of regional desertification.", "Home to resilient, semi-nomadic pastoral communities reliant on seasonal grazing.", "Sustains large herds of cattle and goats through a network of deep communal wells.", "Highlights the extreme climatic and agricultural challenges of the West African interior."]
