      en: ["Subtle, heavily eroded laterite and sand embankments near the southern border.", "Mark the ancient, historic coastline before the ocean receded to its current level.", "The porous, vertical faces are highly favored by specialized burrowing bird species.", "Hosts massive, vibrant breeding colonies of birds like the Carmine Bee-eater.", "The birds excavate deep nesting tunnels, creating a distinct 'swiss-cheese' visual effect.", "A highly popular, specialized destination for international ornithologists."]
