      en: ["A dense, community-managed tract of woodland in the Kombo South district.", "Situated on gently sloping, well-drained soils supporting massive ancient hardwoods.", "Fiercely protected by local communities against illegal logging and urban sprawl.", "The primary, sustainable source of specialized timber for local artisans.", "Wood from this forest is used to carve traditional djembe drums and kora bases.", "Represents a perfect symbiosis between deep forest conservation and cultural arts."]
